                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "to be honest this is barely a game, let alone a vr game. There is basically no agency, and the \"gameplay\" is replaying the game to solve riddler puzzles. It looks nice, and the story is \"novel\" but that's about all it has going for it. replaying the game is a pain because there is no pause menu I can access on a steam frame, there is no way to skip dialogue, you just sit and wait for the exposition to be done so you can move on again.",
